# The build context is os/pkgs/mosd/deb/, the producer family directory, and
# this producer needs two things out of it: the shared copyright file and its
# own control templates. Everything else -- this README, and the sibling
# producer that lands beside it -- is excluded, so an edit there does not
# invalidate this producer's context.
#
# The binaries and the unit files are NOT here. They arrive through the `bin`
# and `dist` named contexts, which is what keeps a cargo target directory of
# several gigabytes out of the path buildx has to walk.
*
!copyright
!mosd/control/*.control
